1
00:00:00,580 --> 00:00:02,170
Therapist: I see each of my patients

2
00:00:02,220 --> 00:00:03,780
Therapist: for one hour a week.

3
00:00:04,060 --> 00:00:06,960
Therapist: The other one hundred and sixty-seven hours,

4
00:00:06,920 --> 00:00:08,180
Therapist: I’m in the dark.

5
00:00:08,650 --> 00:00:10,500
Therapist: Did they do their exercises?

6
00:00:10,430 --> 00:00:11,660
Therapist: Take their meds?

7
00:00:11,610 --> 00:00:13,280
Therapist: Was Tuesday a bad day?

8
00:00:13,470 --> 00:00:15,140
Therapist: I only find out a week later.

9
00:00:16,260 --> 00:00:17,940
Therapist: My calendar is full.

10
00:00:17,890 --> 00:00:19,610
Therapist: New patients wait for weeks.

11
00:00:20,310 --> 00:00:24,140
Therapist: And at 4 a.m., a patient messages me, panicking.

12
00:00:24,040 --> 00:00:25,080
Therapist: I want to help.

13
00:00:25,120 --> 00:00:27,110
Therapist: I just can’t be awake for everyone.

14
00:00:27,460 --> 00:00:30,380
Therapist: I need something that’s there for them between sessions,

15
00:00:30,660 --> 00:00:31,960
Therapist: and keeps me in the loop.

16
00:00:32,550 --> 00:00:33,600
Now there is.

17
00:00:36,050 --> 00:00:37,610
Your own practice app.

18
00:00:37,510 --> 00:00:38,880
Patients check in every day:

19
00:00:38,930 --> 00:00:40,600
mood, sleep, and anxiety.

20
00:00:41,220 --> 00:00:43,480
Every exercise you assign is tracked,

21
00:00:43,430 --> 00:00:45,440
so you see their progress before they walk in.

22
00:00:46,050 --> 00:00:49,220
At 4 a.m., AI guides them through the moment,

23
00:00:49,120 --> 00:00:50,940
with the coping steps you’ve approved.

24
00:00:51,240 --> 00:00:53,580
Warning signs reach you right away,

25
00:00:53,480 --> 00:00:55,820
and crisis support is always one tap away.

26
00:00:56,420 --> 00:00:57,940
Even people on your waitlist

27
00:00:57,840 --> 00:00:59,380
get support while they wait.

28
00:00:59,660 --> 00:01:01,780
Therapist: Now I walk into every session,

29
00:01:01,680 --> 00:01:03,700
Therapist: knowing how their week really went.

30
00:01:04,510 --> 00:01:06,900
Therapist, psychiatrist, or clinic?

31
00:01:06,800 --> 00:01:08,370
Reach out to us.

32
00:01:08,270 --> 00:01:09,460
Let’s build your app together,

33
00:01:09,470 --> 00:01:11,460
and help more people, every single day.
